    "description": "<p>Silent, swift, and deadly, the Ghost Fox teaches that a whisper can kill louder than a scream. You move through shadows and strike with ghostly grace.</p>\n<p>You strike from nowhere, unseen and unstoppable. Whilst in this form, you gain the following modifiers:</p>\n<ul><li>Add you Int mod to all Stealth skill checks.</li><li>When attacking a flat-footed target, add your Int mod as base damage</li></ul>\n<p><em>Automated:</em> press Combat Form's Use to enter it (1 AP, a stance). +Int to Stealth checks, and +Int damage against a target flat-footed to you. All its modifiers are class bonuses.</p>",
